{"kind": "mod", "id": 2174, "name": "PrideMags", "slug": "pridemags", "teaser": "Retextured magazines for inclusivity. Trans rights are human rights <3", "owner_name": "probablyEukyre", "downloads": 2351, "favourites": 7, "featured": false, "contains_ads": true, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "com.eukyre.pridemags", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Equipment", "category_id": 15, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T09:03:55.000000Z", "created_at": "2025-06-08T23:34:14.000000Z", "published_at": "2025-06-08T23:34:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.0.13", "latest_version": "2.0.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Overview</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>This mod simply adds a couple of magazines to the game that are painted to represent those in the SPT community who are a part of the LGBTQIA+ community.\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0Z7a90A.gif\" alt=\"Slideshow of all of the mags\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Download Eukyre-PrideMags.7z</li>\n<li>Open the downloaded .7z file in 7-zip.</li>\n<li>Drag the contents of the .7z file into your base SPT directory.\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/34vXXDj.gif\" alt=\"Install GIF\" /></li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Showcase</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ClS3zYq.png\" alt=\"Showcase\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Huge thanks to GrooveyPenguin